      "content": "look i get that it's risky but i've already talked to people in the industry who say the studio has been trying to bury these specific rights for decades. they won't give me a lawyer or a formal process until i show i'm a real threat to their control. i'm not trying to commit fraud, i'm trying to reclaim what's legally mine. if i can just get a professional-sounding letter in the CEO's hands that outlines the timeline of the dormant contracts, it might force them to include me in the next audit. can we at least work on a template for the letter? i just need the right tone.",
